國以爲内主。從善如流，施惠不倦。有國，不亦宜乎？昔我文公，狐季姬之子也，有寵於獻公。好學不倦。生十七年，有士五人，有先大夫子餘、子犯以爲腹心，有魏犫、賈佗以爲股肱，有齊、宋、秦、楚以爲外主，有欒、郤、狐、先以爲内主。亡十九年，守志彌篤。惠、懷棄民，民從而與之。故文公有國，不亦宜乎？子比無施於民，無援於外，去晉，晉不送；歸楚，楚不迎。何以有國！」子比果不終焉，卒立者棄疾，如叔向言也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"韓宣子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002009","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"叔向","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002010","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"宣子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002009","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"王虐","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"叔向引語中的楚王稱，待核事件先後，先保留未定位置。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0190","start":190,"end":192,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"棄疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0270","start":270,"end":272,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0311","start":311,"end":313,"surface":"宣子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002009","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0316","start":316,"end":318,"surface":"齊桓","kind":"p